{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>無綫劇集《夫妻的博弈》進入結局周，劇情愈趨白熱化。日前一集講到，一直被蒙在鼓裡的雪文 Sherman（郭柏妍飾）終於推斷出，原來幸如（高海寧飾）才是暗中推動一切、導致自己陷入不幸的幕後黑手。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_057494014139eb6c-171\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>氣急敗壞的 Sherman 隨即找幸如攤牌對質，兩人在激烈糾纏期間，意外令幸如回想起更多當天車禍中失落的記憶。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_057494014139eb6c-171\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f85592a6-9497-4d36-aceb-cf5bb27ad766.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20268dXiHRkRC81788427000.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f85592a6-9497-4d36-aceb-cf5bb27ad766.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_057494014139eb6c-171\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_057494014139eb6c-171\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_057494014139eb6c-172\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>原來在發生車禍當日，幸如前往慶功宴期間，竟當場撞破最好的閨密 Sherman 與自己的男友繼威 Mark（張頴康飾）正在忘我接吻。最過分的是，Sherman 其實一早見到幸如撞破二人親熱，但她不但沒有即時收手，反而刻意繼續，一心只想令幸如難堪。目擊最信任的兩個人同時背叛自己，令幸如難以置信，心痛與驚訝交雜。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_057494014139eb6c-172\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"84edacf9-6fbf-4125-a958-016a2092ada7.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026DCGSRFmylP1788427000.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"84edacf9-6fbf-4125-a958-016a2092ada7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b5d0dbd3-d6ee-438b-8734-1c9fc9a94c82.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xQliyBMTuJ1788427000.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b5d0dbd3-d6ee-438b-8734-1c9fc9a94c82.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_057494014139eb6c-173\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>談到這幕撞破郭柏妍與張頴康親熱的重頭戲，高海寧接受 </span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>tvb.com</span></a><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'> 獨家訪問時直言印象十分深刻：「因為我見到自己最好嘅朋友背叛我同我男朋友搞埋一齊，理應係要好嬲，但嗰刻我仲同雪文講當冇事發生，叫佢唔好追住我，所以我演嘅時候都會覺得點解佢要咁懦弱。」不過她亦補充，正因為角色當時的懦弱，才促使她日後下定決心徹底轉變人生，與前後形成了強烈的對比。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T09:40:08.334568+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":478,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}